# ABAP working folders (analysis, CRs, local projects)
# Any folder starting with Z is excluded automatically.
# This covers: ZCL_*, ZIF_*, ZSD_*, ZSDR_*, ZSDE_*, ZFM_*, etc.
# To upload a specific Z* folder, use: git add -f <folder>
Z*/
